---
// Added in the figures pass: numbers come from the post text and captures.
const W = 900, H = 220;
---
<figure class="bep5e">
  <div class="bep5e-scroll">
  <svg viewBox={`0 0 ${W} ${H}`} role="img" aria-label="Three boxes in order. First, DATABASE_URL, the first line to touch. Second, the pool settings, tuned against Postgres's own limit. Third, a load test against your production database, drawn in red because it is the step not measured in this post.">
    <text x="60" y="50" text-anchor="start" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>SqlCaseRepository and layered_service.py: unchanged</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>SqlCaseRepository và layered_service.py: không đổi</tspan></text>
    <rect x="60" y="84" width="240" height="96" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="180" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>1. DATABASE_URL</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>1. DATABASE_URL</tspan></text>
    <text x="180" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>the first line to touch</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>dòng đầu tiên phải sửa</tspan></text>
    <line x1="300" y1="132" x2="330" y2="132" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="340,132 330,127 330,137" class="hd" />
    <rect x="340" y="84" width="240" height="96" rx="10" class="box" />
    <text x="460" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>2. pool settings</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>2. pool settings</tspan></text>
    <text x="460" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>tune against Postgres's own limit</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>chỉnh theo giới hạn của Postgres</tspan></text>
    <line x1="580" y1="132" x2="610" y2="132" class="ln" />
    <polygon points="620,132 610,127 610,137" class="hd" />
    <rect x="620" y="84" width="240" height="96" rx="10" class="badfill" />
    <text x="740" y="118" text-anchor="middle" class="nm"><tspan data-lang-en>3. load test</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>3. load test</tspan></text>
    <text x="740" y="146" text-anchor="middle" class="sub"><tspan data-lang-en>against your production database</tspan><tspan data-lang-vi>trên database production thật</tspan></text>
  </svg>
  </div>
  <figcaption>
    <span data-lang-en>What to do when moving to Postgres, in order. The code under the service stays as it is.</span>
    <span data-lang-vi>Thứ tự việc cần làm khi chuyển sang Postgres. Code bên dưới service giữ nguyên.</span>
  </figcaption>
</figure>

<style>
  .bep5e { margin: 2em 0; width: 100%; }
  .bep5e-scroll { overflow-x: auto; }
  .bep5e svg { display: block; width: 100%; min-width: 640px; height: auto; }
  .bep5e text { font-size: 13.5px; fill: var(--text-body); font-variant-numeric: tabular-nums; }
  .bep5e .nm { font-weight: 700; fill: var(--text); font-size: 14.5px; }
  .bep5e .sub { fill: var(--text-muted); font-size: 12.5px; }
  .bep5e .box { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--border); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5e .seam { fill: none; stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; stroke-dasharray: 6 4; }
  .bep5e .bad { fill: none; stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5e .badfill { fill: var(--red-tint-bg); stroke: var(--red); stroke-width: 1.8; }
  .bep5e .ln { stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.6; fill: none; }
  .bep5e .hd { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5e .redt { fill: var(--red); font-weight: 700; }
  .bep5e .dot { fill: var(--text-muted); }
  .bep5e .dotbad { fill: var(--red); }
  .bep5e .slot { fill: var(--bg-alt); stroke: var(--text-muted); stroke-width: 1.4; }
  .bep5e figcaption { margin-top: 10px; font-size: 14px; color: var(--text-muted); line-height: 1.55; text-align: center; }
</style>
